:\"https://diceify.art/terms\",\"acquireLicensePage\":\"https://diceify.art/terms\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://diceify.art/blog/jeremy-dice-portraits-nieces\"},\"keywords\":\"Community, Gift Ideas\",\"articleSection\":\"Community Stories\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://diceify.art\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Blog\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://diceify.art/blog\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"How I Made Dice Portraits for My Nieces\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://diceify.art/blog/jeremy-dice-portraits-nieces\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative z-[2] max-w-[800px] mx-auto w-full px-6 py-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--text-dim)] hover:text-[var(--pink)] transition-colors mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"width\":\"20\",\"height\":\"20\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"2\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7\"}]}],\"Back to Blog\"]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-article\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"Community\",{\"className\":\"blog-tag\",\"children\":\"Community\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"Gift Ideas\",{\"className\":\"blog-tag\",\"children\":\"Gift Ideas\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-syne text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-4\",\"children\":\"How I Made Dice Portraits for My Nieces\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"By\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://jeremyklammer.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--pink)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Jeremy Klammer\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"November 21, 2023\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"4 min read\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-content frosted-glass rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-lead\",\"children\":\"Jeremy Klammer wanted to make something special for his nieces' birthdays. In 2023, he created dice portraits — their faces made out of actual dice, then painted to match their personalities.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-note\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Note:\"}],\" Jeremy used an early version of Diceify that was built during COVID. The interface looks different now, but the core idea is the same.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"The idea\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Jeremy makes custom gifts for his nieces every year. For K's 5th birthday and C's 8th birthday, he decided dice portraits would be memorable and unique.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Each finished piece measures 35 × 47 inches — larger than originally planned, but the bigger size made the portraits really stand out.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"The process\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":\"Finding the right photo\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Jeremy tested 20-30 photos of each girl in Diceify before finding the ones that worked best. Clear, straight-on shots produced the best results. Side angles and busy backgrounds didn't translate as well to the dice pattern.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Once he found the right photos, he adjusted the cropping and zoom until the dice pattern looked right, then saved it as a template for the physical build.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":\"Building the frame\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"For the physical construction, Jeremy:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Made a plywood base backed with 2×4s to prevent warping\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Used frames sized 26×32 inches to fit a 35×47 dice grid\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Laid out all the dice on a flat surface first, matching the Diceify template\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Transferred them row by row to the frame with Liquid Nails\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Painted the backgrounds after everything was glued down\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Personal touches\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Each portrait was customized to reflect the personality of each girl.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":\"K's portrait\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Her favorite colors: pink, purple, and turquoise\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"A yellow school bus in the background — she had just started riding the bus that year\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":\"C's portrait\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Sunset colors: red, orange, and yellow\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Pink bubble pattern in the background — she'd just learned to blow bubble gum bubbles\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"The fingerprint tradition\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"One special touch: at each birthday party, all the guests put their fingerprints on the artwork. Parents, grandparents, cousins, friends — whoever attended. It's a tradition Jeremy started at his oldest niece's first birthday, turning each piece into a memory of who was there.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Time investment\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Each piece took over 100 hours to complete. Jeremy notes that now that he knows the process, future pieces would go faster. His tips for anyone trying this:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Test lots of photos before committing to one\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Straight-on, well-lit shots work best\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Lay everything out before gluing\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Add something personal to make the gift meaningful\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-cta\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"children\":\"Want to try it yourself?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Use Diceify to generate the dice pattern, then build it however you like.\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{\"href\":\"/editor\",\"className\":\"btn-primary\",\"children\":\"Open the editor\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-divider\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"blog-source\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Source:\"}],\" This article is based on Jeremy Klammer's original blog post. See more photos and details on his website:\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://jeremyklammer.com/2023/11/21/dice-art/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"blog-source-link\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"width\":\"16\",\"height\":\"16\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"}],[\"$\",\"polyline\",null,{\"points\":\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"}],[\"$\",\"line\",null,{\"x1\":\"10\",\"y1\":\"14\",\"x2\":\"21\",\"y2\":\"3\"}]]}],\"Dice Portraits – Klammer Lab\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"btn-secondary\",\"children\":\"← More Stories\"}]}]]}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"e:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"title\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"How I Made Dice Portraits for My Nieces | Diceify\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Jeremy shares how he used Diceify to make birthday gifts for his nieces — real dice arranged into portraits, painted with their favorite colors.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://jeremyklammer.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Jeremy Klammer\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"6\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/manifest.json\",\"crossOrigin\":\"use-credentials\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"dice art,dice portrait,dice art generator,dice mosaic,dice portrait generator,dice picture generator,dice mosaic generator,dice mosaic maker,photo to dice,dice pixel art,diy art project,dice art gift,personalized gift ideas,personalized photo gift,custom portrait gift,unique gift ideas,diy gift ideas,handmade gift ideas,personalized birthday gift,anniversary gift ideas,christmas gift ideas,gift for board game lovers\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"Diceify\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"Diceify\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://diceify.art/blog/jeremy-dice-portraits-nieces\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\"